tion with Path Contacts is that yes, they get their dots assigned when the Contact is Invoked and those two tags endure through the session. Once the session ends, the dots vanish so that when Invoked on another Session, you can reassign them.</div> </div> </div> </div>So if I am understanding what you are saying, the player would create a contact for each path, but modify it with the tags once invoked during the session. The contacts themselves would persist from session to session but not their tags or ratings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10979-phorden","name":"phorden","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T12:13:58-08:00","id":1370421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>phorden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1370100-asking-for-help-with-understanding-a-couple-of-rules?p=1370207#post1370207\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So if I am understanding what you are saying, the player would create a contact for each path, but modify it with the tags once invoked during the session. The contacts themselves would persist from session to session but not their tags or ratings.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can run it like that. And if you keep hitting up Frank at thr library for similar things, you'll probably settle on the same tags when you hit him up.<br /> <br /> Of course sometimes you may need to ask 